=== COMPILER2 DIAGNOSTICS ===
  [type] E0167

  ⚠ this condition is always truthy: a value of type `true` can never be falsy
    ╭─[precedence.baml:10:11]
 10 │   let d = true || false && false;  // Should be true (AND before OR)
    ·           ────    ───────┬──────
    ·             │            ╰── this expression is unreachable
    ╰────

  [type] E0167

  ⚠ this condition is always falsy: a value of type `false` can never be truthy
    ╭─[precedence.baml:10:19]
 10 │   let d = true || false && false;  // Should be true (AND before OR)
    ·                   ─────    ──┬──
    ·                     │        ╰── this expression is unreachable
    ╰────
